that the forest actually.

00:44:26.340 --> 00:44:27.173
It's making the rain.

00:44:27.173 --> 00:44:28.740
It makes the rain,

00:44:28.740 --> 00:44:32.550
and it draws in all the moisture.

00:44:32.550 --> 00:44:34.950
